  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In treasure yellow heaven, Star Lord Wan Xiang’s will lists three star path killer moves; dazzling star armor is first. Activation needs large numbers of starlight Gu, a few bane star Gu, several star shield Gu, and other Gu. Wan Xiang prices it at half an immortal essence stone.",
