    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan, buying as Eight Arm Immortal, already knows the move though he is not a star path Gu Immortal, and judges half a stone too expensive for something so common. He later offers two immortal essence stones for spring star rain, dazzling star armor, and star shoot Gu for ten spring star rain casts; Wan Xiang refuses that package. Fang Yuan reads high value in Wan Xiang’s mind, and from his previous life he takes it that before the five regions war the move has not been spread by the respective forces, so its value stays high. He then buys spring star rain alone and leaves the armor unsold in that bargain.",
